    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u2605 The very first Spot the Difference game in 3D!</strong><br>It's not the Spot the Difference game like you've seen before! <br>You have to rotate the screen in the 3D world to find the answers.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Compete through the Challenge Mode</strong><br>Clear the 5 random stages faster than anyone else and register your score on the Leaderboard to compete with others.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Animation and zoom in feature</strong><br>The characters in each stage have broken through their static images with simple animations.<br>Use the zoom in feature during the game.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Stages divided into 5 themes</strong><br>Play each stage in 5 cute or cool themes such as Monster, Western, City, and so on.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Raise Hint Pets</strong><br>Cats, dogs, and turtles help your gameplay in different ways.<br>They'll find the correct answer for you or adjust the time for you. Level up to improve your abilities.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>\u2605 The very first Spot the Difference game in 3D!</strong><br>It's not the Spot the Difference game like you've seen before! <br>You have to rotate the screen in the 3D world to find the answers.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Compete through the Challenge Mode</strong><br>Clear the 5 random stages faster than anyone else and register your score on the Leaderboard to compete with others.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Animation and zoom in feature</strong><br>The characters in each stage have broken through their static images with simple animations.<br>Use the zoom in feature during the game.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Stages divided into 5 themes</strong><br>Play each stage in 5 cute or cool themes such as Monster, Western, City, and so on.<br><br><strong>\u2605 Raise Hint Pets</strong><br>Cats, dogs, and turtles help your gameplay in different ways.<br>They'll find the correct answer for you or adjust the time for you. Level up to improve your abilities.",
    "short_description": "The first ever brand new 3D Spot the difference game!",
